        "question": "Besides the transcript exporter's documented write access, which principals have read access to the training store?",
        "rationale": "The document only restricts write access; unrestricted or broad read access to a store of unredacted customer PII would be a major exposure path not currently addressed.",
        "related_object_key": "training_store",
        "priority": "high",
